     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "text": "1. Moulded in white UF, gloss front. Wall 1.8, edge bevel in two steps (84 at 6.5 high, 80 at 8.5).",
     "size": 3,
     "bold": false,
     "x": 30.0,
     "y": 212.0,
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "text": "2. Rocker aperture 14.6 x 24.6, R1 corners, with a 0.7 high lip 17.6 x 27.6 round it.",
     "size": 3,
     "bold": false,
     "x": 30.0,
     "y": 218.0,
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "text": "3. Screw holes \u00d83.8 through bosses \u00d87.5 at 60.3 centres. Two ribs 20.6 x 1.2 above and below the aperture.",
     "size": 3,
     "bold": false,
     "x": 30.0,
     "y": 224.0,
     "type": "text"
    }
